      "content": "rebuilding feels like a joke. what am i supposed to rebuild? the people i used to know won't even take my calls. my reputation is radioactive. it's not just that i lost my job, it's that the version of me that actually mattered is dead. you talk about being a survivor, but sometimes the only thing left to do is just accept that it's over.",
